        "Returning from a nested excerpt restores the outer source-cleaning context",
        "Nested excerpt callbacks do not change the outer excerpt result",
        "A manually written excerpt is not regenerated",
        "Percent and underscore in filenames remain literal data, not SQL wildcards",
        "A SQL-looking filename fragment cannot broaden the attachment query",
        "Short needle lists are padded without manufacturing additional matches",
        "Exact URL variants retain caller priority even when a lower-priority candidate is newer",
